---
description: Tailwind v4 and theme token usage
globs: **/*.vue, **/*.css
alwaysApply: false
---
No tailwind.config.js — theme via @theme directive in assets/css/main.css.
Use only tokens defined in the @theme block. Arbitrary values like text-[#3a4f] require justification.
Use @tailwindcss/forms classes for form styling baseline.
